---@field compliance? gcp.ondemandscanning_v1.ComplianceOccurrence Describes a compliance violation on a linked resource.
---@field kind? gcp.ondemandscanning_v1.OccurrenceKindEnum Output only. This explicitly denotes which of the occurrence details are specified. This field can be used as a filter in list requests.
